;; Ternary cycle join inside the incremental artifacts (docs/wcoj.md §15):
;; after the driver binds A and B, the two remaining key-simple occurrences
;; close over C as one join3 action in the normal, _count, _maint1, and
;; _maint3neg plans.  No source-program EDB: session batches feed edge so
;; its assertions are editable input.

table (edge int int)
table (wtri int int int)

rule
(edge A B)
(edge B C)
(edge A C)
-->
(wtri A B C)
